\f0\b Segment and track filaments in TSOAX
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\li720\fi-720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	1.	}Open TSOAX\
{\listtext	2.	}Open TIFF time-lapse image in TSOAX\
{\listtext	3.	}Adjust settings and click Initialize Snakes. Readjust settings if initialization is poor.\
{\listtext	4.	}Click Deform Snakes\
\pard\tx940\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\li1440\fi-1440\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl1\cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8259 	}this process can range from seconds to hours depending on the size of the time-lapse image and number of objects to segment\
\pard\tx220\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\li720\fi-720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	5.	}Click Track Snakes\
\pard\tx940\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\li1440\fi-1440\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl1\cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8259 	}this can also range from seconds to hours depending on the size of the time-lapse image and number of objects to track\
\pard\tx220\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\li720\fi-720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	6.	}Save the segmented and tracked filaments (also called \'93snakes\'94). This produces a large .txt file.\
{\listtext	7.	}Close TSOAX\
