\f0\b \cf0 Validate tracked filaments and calculate actin parameters in SMAUG
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\tx940\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\li720\fi-720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	1.	}Run the Python script \'93elongation_rate_analysis_v6.py\'94\
{\listtext	2.	}When prompted, select the snake file produced by TSOAX and then the corresponding TIFF time-lapse image\
{\listtext	3.	}Navigate through the saved tracks and save filaments that were tracked accurately. Adjust the frame boundaries to save a portion of a track if part is tracked well.\
{\listtext	4.	}Close SMAUG\
\pard\tx720\tx940\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
